  "details": "Description\n\nWhen I try to travel to other worlds it reloads me to my home world. If I try too many times it says Im traveling too fast.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nLoad VR, Wait for home world to load, select world I want to travel to and click join, screen goes to world loading screen, quickly flips to home screen and loads home world. I have to do this 20+ times before I get any where.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: World\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-29_17-16-30.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_0a0fffd5-a197-4bd8-a382-a8559756e86e/1/file)",
